      "Source": "An armor-piercing arrow infused with Basic Essence.<#RN#>Base Damage: 65<#RN#>Initial Torpor: 390<#RN#>Torpor Over 5 Seconds: 195<#RN#>Total Torpor Potential: 585<#RN#><#RN#>Numbers are multiplied by Weapon Quality %.",
