    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1457810027",
      "Source": "Ripper",
      "Trans": {"SC":"撕裂者","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1594162455",
      "Source": "A chainsaw better suited at cutting flesh than cutting trees. Does greatly increased damage, and causes massive bleed damage.<#N#><#N#>Requires Rage Souls for fuel.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种更适合切割血肉而非树木的链锯。可造成大幅提升的伤害, 并引发巨量流血伤害。<#N#><#N#>需以Rage Souls作为燃料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3367456854",
      "Source": "Taming Potion",
      "Trans": {"SC":"驯服药水","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4099015846",
      "Source": "Instantly Drops the food on a KO dino to zero, making it tame much quicker.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这药水能让被打晕恐龙的食物度瞬间清零, 从而大幅缩短其驯服时间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::796082236",
      "Source": "Thunderbolt",
      "Trans": {"SC":"雷电茅","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::476082133",
      "Source": "Charged bolts that deal both lightning damage and cause a Lightning Strike on impact.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在击中时可造成闪电伤害, 且命中时会触发一次闪电打击。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3628144314",
      "Source": "Risk",
      "Trans": {"SC":"加特林","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3577518319",
      "Source": "The deadliest gun of all, but its not without downsides.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"最致命的枪, 且它并非没有缺点。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2296909220",
      "Source": "Gauntlet Beacon",
      "Trans": {"SC":"挑战信标","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1443192707",
      "Source": "The Gauntlet Beacon is an upgraded Omega Beacon that is only capable of summoning Beacon Bosses. However, it can be filled with hundreds of stacks of souls and made to summon Bosses every 10 seconds until the souls are gone. This allows you to use a single beacon to farm Bosses effortlessly.<#N#><#N#>Once placed, open its inventory, select the soul type, then the Boss tier, and then press Summon. Bosses will spawn every 10 seconds until souls are expended.<#N#><#N#>This beacon does not spawn World Bosses when their timers expire.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"挑战信标是Omega信标的升级版, 仅用于召唤信标Bosses。其核心优势在于可放置数百组的灵魂, 实现每10秒召唤一次Bosses, 直至灵魂耗尽, 让玩家能通过单个信标轻松刷Bosses。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2531809842",
      "Source": "Mek Blueprint",
      "Trans": {"SC":"机甲蓝图","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::173386800",
      "Source": "A completed Mek blueprint.<#N#>Use this item to summon a tamed Mek from the pieces dropped by Beacon Bosses.<#N#><#N#>For variants and tiers, meks require a module to be crafted in the Soul Grinder. The soul used to craft the module will determine the variant. Swapping modules on a Mek will change its variant.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一份完整的机甲蓝图。<#N#>使用此物品可从信标Bosses掉落物中召唤一只已驯服的机甲。<#N#><#N#>对于variants和tiers, 机甲需要在灵魂研磨机中制作模块。制作模块所用的灵魂将决定其变种, 而在机甲上更换模块会改变其变种形态。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::256949478",
      "Source": "Beta Metal Knockout Arrow",
      "Trans": {"SC":"Beta四阶金属击晕箭","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::713721271",
