    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::2FBD480F4C102C729C8847A2F71EBD7A",
      "Source": "CONFIRM RESPAWN?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"CONFIRM RESPAWN?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2888412078"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "8EAAF298480DC9295C4459B7D51DC78F",
      "Source": "Dimensional Sort Inventory<#RN#>This button triggers the void vacuum effect on your current inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"分类打包至次元空间<#RN#>此按钮会对你当前的背包触发虚空吸尘器效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2246667211"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "0162DE7F465AB8AEE4D9FE8BA955AC52",
      "Source": "Quantum Compress Personal Resources<#RN#>This button sends items in your current inventory into your Personal Quantum System , making them weightless and able to be pulled from anywhere. No structures are involved and the storage is infinite. Selecting a single item will only attempt to send that item into storage. These items travel with you when transferring maps.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"打包至个人次元空间<#RN#>此按钮会将你当前物品栏中的物品发送至个人次元空间，使其变为无重量状态，且可从任何位置提取。该功能不涉及任何建筑，存储空间无限。选择单个物品时，只会尝试将该物品送入存储。这些物品会在你转移地图时随你一同迁移。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"220556357"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "316F176F48774E088C5615A8AC469B42",
      "Source": "Quantum Compress Tribe Resources<#RN#>This button sends items in your current inventory into the Quantum System (tribe), making them weightless and able to be pulled from anywhere by all tribe members. This storage is considerably safer than using Personal Storage. These items do not travel with you when transferring maps.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"打包至部落次元空间<#RN#>此按钮会将你当前物品栏中的物品发送至部落次元空间，使其变为无重量状态，且部落所有成员均可从任何位置提取。该存储空间比个人存储安全得多。这些物品在你转移地图时不会随你一同迁移。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1569917377"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "4DF407ED48A5DD799529A5836B5DA138",
      "Source": "Personal Quantum Pull Menu<#RN#>This button brings up the pull menu for you to pull items out of your Personal Quantum Storage. This can be accessed from anywhere.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"个人次元空间提取菜单<#RN#>此按钮会调出提取菜单，供您从个人次元空间存储中取出物品。该菜单可在任何位置访问。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2919968647"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "83FC764F4D32F413667A3CB0F262E499",
      "Source": "Tribe Quantum Pull Menu<#RN#>This button brings up the pull menu for you to pull items out of your Tribe Quantum Storage. This can be accessed from anywhere.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"部落次元空间提取菜单<#RN#>此按钮会调出提取菜单，供你从部落次元空间存储中取出物品。该菜单可在任何位置访问。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1201128908"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "5BEA39AA4F9F1305441B92BE7110EB8F",
      "Source": "Repair From Quantum Storage<#RN#>This button will attempt to use your Tribe Quantum Storage, Personal Quantum Storage, and current inventory (in that order) to repair the selected item automatically. If no items are selected, it will attempt to repair everything in your inventory.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从次元空间存储中修复<#RN#>此按钮会尝试按顺序使用你的部落次元空间存储、个人次元空间存储和当前物品栏（按此优先级）自动修复所选物品。若未选中任何物品，它将尝试修复你物品栏中的所有物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2543481215"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "AA1198E948A6970EDC91D887A164DF0F",
      "Source": "Pull To Craft Selected Item<#RN#>This button will attempt to use your Tribe Quantum Storage, Personal Quantum Storage, and current inventory (in that order) to craft the selected blueprint or engram.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"拉取以制作所选物品<#RN#>此按钮会尝试按顺序使用你的部落次元空间存储、个人次元空间存储和当前物品栏（按此优先级）来制作所选蓝图或印痕。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2263199173"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "3F6EF92245C1356F6D1AED8141754429",
      "Source": "OMEGADEX",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欧米伽指南","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2527619425"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "D1F7B5454914D925C20963BB73CD23ED",
      "Source": "Nav Menu",
      "Trans": {"SC":"导航菜单","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2678382762"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "4486A5E7490197668ADCBA877FA913BC",
      "Source": "Welcome",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欢迎","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"857430076"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "7311A2344E49E907DAE27EBDB5C449B0",
      "Source": "Welcome to Ark Omega Ascended! Whether you’re new to the concept of this mod or have played the Ark: Survival Evolved Ark Omega, this guide is a very important resource, so consult it often. <#RN#><#RN#>If this is your very first time opening the guide, try clicking the “Getting Started” button above for a quick-start guide.<#RN#><#RN#>Here is an index of what each of the buttons below is for.<#RN#><#RN#>Calculators: This will tell you what base damage and HP a Boss will have if summoned into your world. It will not tell you about abilities – this is purely raw HP and bite damage.<#RN#><#RN#>Quests: This is where you check your progress on quests obtained by using Quest Scrolls. You can cancel quests or accept rewards for completing them using the buttons beside each entry.<#RN#><#RN#>Piggybacks: Ark Omega Ascended has a unique spawning system, where admins can select a dino species that natively spawns on the map you’re playing on to trigger spawning a dino species that doesn’t natively spawn on your map automatically.<#RN#><#RN#>Omegadex: This is where you check a dino’s base stats, what tamed ones eat, whether they have a unique or legendary saddle and what those do, the name of their uniques, and what variants each unique has.<#RN#><#RN#>[Egg Chart: This will let you check what dinos you have integrated into your Omega Egg Collectors without going back to your base to interact with the structure.]<#RN#><#RN#>Variants: This is where you can check what each variant does. This is organized by variant group.<#RN#><#RN#>Bosses: This is a shortform guide to what each tier of Boss dino does and is, and tells you which structure can be used to summon each.<#RN#><#RN#>Souls: This is a quick summary of what each soul item is for.<#RN#><#RN#>Mating: This is a quick summary of mating settings and what they do, as well as a couple of important niche details about vanilla Ark breeding.<#RN#><#RN#>Miracles: This is where you look to determine what miracles are affecting the world. These are buffs that apply for everyone on the server concurrently.<#RN#><#RN#>Imbues: This is a summary of the stats you gain from imbues on your equipped armor. Please note that built-in effects like the Defender Chestpiece’s 50% damage reduction will not be counted, only the imbues you can re-roll at the imbue workbench.<#RN#><#RN#>Equipment: This is like the Omegadex for gear sets; it lists what each piece does innately. It does not list possible imbues, only the base statistics of each piece in a set and what the full set does.<#RN#><#RN#>Damage Numbers: This is where you can adjust the size, color, and syntax of the Ark Omega Ascended damage number system, or disable it if desired.<#RN#><#RN#>Player Ranks: This is where you can check your player rank, and how many kills of each group and creature type you need to ascend to the next rank. <#RN#><#RN#>Scoreboard: This is where you can compare stats between players on the server – kills, deaths, chests opened, player rank, quest completions, NPC chiefs killed, all of these are tracked.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欢迎来到《方舟：欧米茄飞升》！无论你是初次接触这个模组，还是已经玩过《方舟：生存进化》的 “方舟欧米茄” 版本，本指南都是一份非常重要的参考资料，建议你经常查阅。<#RN#><#RN#>如果你是第一次打开本指南，可以尝试点击上方的 “新手指南” 按钮，获取快速上手教程。<#RN#><#RN#>以下是下方各个按钮的功能说明：<#RN#><#RN#>计算器：显示在你的世界中召唤Boss时，其基础伤害和生命值。此功能不包含Boss的技能信息，仅显示纯粹的基础生命值和咬击伤害。<#RN#>任务：在这里可以查看通过使用 “任务卷轴” 接取的任务进度。你可以通过每个任务条目旁的按钮取消任务，或领取完成任务的奖励。<#RN#>附加生成：《方舟：飞升欧米茄》拥有独特的生成系统，管理员可以选择当前地图原生存在的恐龙物种，触发非原生恐龙物种在地图上自动生成。<#RN#>欧米茄图鉴：查看恐龙的基础属性、已驯服恐龙的食物偏好、是否有独特或传说鞍具及其功能、独特鞍具的名称，以及每种独特鞍具的变体类型。<#RN#>收蛋列表：无需返回基地与相关结构互动，即可查看已整合到 “欧米茄集蛋器” 中的恐龙。<#RN#>生物变体：按变体组分类，展示每种变体的具体效果。<#RN#>Boss：简要介绍各层级Boss恐龙的功能和属性，以及召唤每种Boss所需的建筑。<#RN#>灵魂：快速概述每种灵魂物品的用途。<#RN#>交配：简要说明交配设置及其作用，还包括一些关于《方舟》原版繁殖系统的重要细节。<#RN#>奇迹：查看当前影响世界的 “奇迹” 效果，这些是同时适用于服务器所有玩家的增益 buff。<#RN#>附魔：总结你从已装备盔甲的附魔中获得的属性。请注意，内置效果（如 “防御者胸甲” 的 50% 减伤）不会被计入，仅统计可在附魔工作台重新随机生成的附魔效果。<#RN#>装备：相当于装备套装的 “欧米茄图鉴”，列出每件装备的固有功能。不包含可能的灌注效果，仅显示套装中每件装备的基础属性以及完整套装的效果。<#RN#>伤害数字：在这里可以调整《方舟：欧米茄飞升》伤害数字系统的大小、颜色和显示格式，也可以根据需求关闭该系统。<#RN#>玩家等级：查看你的玩家等级，以及晋升到下一级需要击杀的各类生物和族群的数量。<#RN#>排行榜：比较服务器上玩家之间的各项数据 —— 击杀数、死亡数、打开的宝箱数、玩家等级、任务完成数、击杀的 NPC chiefs数等，这些数据都会被记录。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"302011110"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "77D3BBDB4EC30BB3A55A05BEDDFAEDC3",
      "Source": "Getting Started",
      "Trans": {"SC":"新手指南","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1767468255"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "5B7D7F884B4A7DA085230B84F57C4FB4",
      "Source": "Getting Started (Things You Must Know)<#RN#>So you’ve just started playing, and don’t know where to begin. First off, there will be many new and dangerous creatures wandering around and you may not know how to get started taming them.<#RN#><#RN#>1. The first goal should be to craft an Omega Workbench. This contains most of the items specific to Ark Omega. This includes custom equipment, potions, tranqs, and structures.<#RN#><#RN#>2. Begin gathering souls and essence. These are rewarded to all players in the area when a wild dino is killed. You will get 1 soul corresponding to the group of the killed dino, plus 5 essence corresponding to the tier, Wild dinos will NOT reward souls and essence if knocked out before being killed. Souls and essence are used to craft nearly every item in Ark Omega.<#RN#><#RN#>3. Use your souls and essence to craft the custom weapons in the Omega Workbench. The Multi-Tool acts as an upgrade to the gathering tool, acting as pickaxe, hatchet, club and sickle all in one.<#RN#><#RN#>4. Next step is to craft a kibble station, used to craft every kibble in Ark Omega. <#RN#><#RN#>5. You should begin by taming basic tier dinos of each group to begin progression through the tiers. All dinos require mate boost to lay eggs when outside of an egg collector, with a more detailed explanation in the progression guide.<#RN#><#RN#>6. After these steps are complete, the progression guide tab is crucial to understanding Ark Omegas more complex features.<#RN#><#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"新手指南（玩家须知）<#RN#><#RN#>你刚开始玩这个游戏，可能不知道从哪里入手。首先，游戏里会有许多新的危险生物四处游荡，你可能也不清楚该如何开始驯服它们。<#RN#><#RN#>1.首要目标是制作一个欧米茄工作台。这个工作台包含《方舟：欧米茄》中大多数特有的物品，包括定制装备、药剂、麻醉剂和建筑结构。<#RN#><#RN#>2.开始收集灵魂和精华。当野生恐龙被击杀时，该区域的所有玩家都会获得这些奖励。你会得到 1 个与被击杀恐龙所属族群对应的灵魂，以及 5 个与该恐龙等级对应的精华。如果野生恐龙在被击杀前先被打晕，就不会掉落灵魂和精华。灵魂和精华几乎是制作《方舟：欧米茄》中所有物品的材料。<#RN#><#RN#>3.用你的灵魂和精华在欧米茄工作台中制作定制武器。多功能工具是采集工具的升级版，集镐、斧、棒和镰刀的功能于一身。<#RN#><#RN#>4.下一步是制作一个饲料站，用来制作《方舟：欧米茄》中的所有饲料。<#RN#><#RN#>5.你应该先驯服每个族群中的基础等级恐龙，以此开启不同等级的进阶之路。所有恐龙在蛋收集器之外的地方产卵时，都需要 “配偶加成”，进阶指南中有更详细的说明。<#RN#><#RN#>6.完成这些步骤后，进阶指南标签页对于理解《方舟：欧米茄》中更复杂的功能至关重要。<#RN#><#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1767449226"}
    },
