    {
      "NamespaceHash": "02B1D5F64D1AE37B0ABD9AA23CDF9A3A",
      "Source": "New character? First time playing? Here are the things you need to know immediately.<#N#> <#N#>1.) You have a newbie buff, with a countdown timer in your buff list at the bottom right. This gives you damage reduction, increased magic find (increases dynamic item drop rate, like Unique Weapons and Set Armors), bonus experience gain, and makes wild creatures ignore you unless provoked. Make use of it, because once it wears out, they will come after you, and you cannot get the buff back.<#N#>2.) You were given a number of starter items, make use of these for a much quicker start.<#N#>-The Knockout Club deals much more torpor than a regular club.<#N#>-The Gathering Tool works as a Metal Hatchet and Metal Pick. Middle mouse button to switch modes.<#N#>-The Gathering Sickle works the same as using your hands to harvest, but at 7x the rate. <#N#><#N#>The things you should focus on first:<#N#>1.) Using your starting tools to gather resources and level up. <#N#>2.) Finding weak dinos like vanilla dodos to kill for hide and experience.<#N#>3.) Establish a small temporary base, in a cave or a safe area, away from any danger.<#N#>4.) Craft an Omega Workbench and Imbue Workbench to prepare to progress.<#N#>5.) Collect Souls/Essence by killing weak base tier dinos or being near them when they die.<#N#>6.) Once you have enough souls/essence, craft a starter weapon. Ethereal Spear, Hades Torch, Multi-Tool recommended.<#N#>7.) If you havent already, craft some armor, even if its primitive Cloth.<#N#>8.) Imbue your armor in the Imbue Workbench using the highest tier essence you can afford.<#N#><#N#>Here are some things you should know while getting started.<#N#>1.) Dying Creatures will reward Souls/Essence in a small area. You do not need to make the kill.<#N#>2.) Imbue a full set of primitive gear with your first 5 Omega essence for a great stat boost.<#N#>3.) Resource dinos will periodically poop 5 of their designated resource and can be harvested for more. <#N#>4.) A Multi-Tool can harvest nearly everything, and bypasses Resource variant damage reduction.<#N#>5.) Spiritual Potions can be lifesavers early on for your player, doubling your movement speed and giving you infinite weight.<#N#>6.) A Net Gun is an infinitely reusable weapon that is far easier to use and aim than a Bola.<#N#>7.) Loot chests spawn in random locations. They are unlocked with essence and contain large stacks of souls, weapons, etc.<#N#>8.) Omega has a dynamic drop system similar to most looter games, meaning when you kill things, they may drop Unique/Set items, custom charms, medallions, and more to greatly strengthen your player.<#N#><#N#>With a good starter weapon, some imbued armor, and a starter base, move onto the next section and begin taming.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"新角色? 第一次玩? 那你最好看一下这个说明。<#RN#> <#RN#>1.) 开局你会获得一个新手Buff, 它是有时效的。这个Buff可以让你减伤、提高掉落物品的机率(比如独特武器和套装护甲)、额外的经验奖励、并且若你不去挑衅野怪的情况它将会无视你。好好利用这个Buff效果, 因为这个Buff无法再次获取了。<#RN#>2.) 你会获得下列开荒套件, 好好运用这些工具来开荒吧。<#RN#>-“击晕木棒”造成的眩晕效果比普通棍棒强得多。<#RN#>-“采集工具”可当作金属斧和金属镐使用。可通过鼠标中键切换模式。<#RN#>-“采集镰刀”作用和徒手采集相同, 但采集速度是徒手采集的七倍。<#RN#><#RN#>首先你要做的是:<#RN#>1.) 利用开荒工具来采集资源并且快速升级。<#RN#>2.) 找像渡渡鸟这种弱小来杀, 这样可以快速获取兽皮和经验值。<#RN#>3.) 找一个远离危险地带的地方, 洞穴或者是相对安全的地方来搭建一个据点。<#RN#>4.) 制作一个欧米伽和附魔工作台。<#RN#>5.) 杀一些Base级别的弱小恐龙来获取“灵魂”或“精华”。<#RN#>6.) 当你有了足够的“灵魂”或“精华”就制作一把武器, 这里推荐制作: 空灵长矛, 冥王火炬, 多用途工具。<#RN#>7.) 一定要穿护甲, 哪怕是原始的粗布护甲也可以。<#RN#>8.) 在附魔工作台对你的护甲进行附魔, 最好是能提升多好就多好。<#RN#><#RN#>下列是起步时需要了解的一些事项:<#RN#>1.) 生物死后会在周围掉落“灵魂”或“精华”。非你杀死的, 若你在附近也可以获取这些奖励。<#RN#>2.) 使用5个欧米伽精华对一整套原始装备进行附魔, 这样可以大幅度提升装备属性。<#RN#>3.) 资源系的生物会定期排出5个对应类的资源, 并且还可采集的更多。<#RN#>4.) 多用途工具几乎可以采集所有东西, 且无视资源类型的伤害减免。<#RN#>5.) 灵魂药(Spiritual Potion)是玩家前期必备的药剂, 它让可令移速翻倍并赋予无限负重。<#RN#>6.) 网枪(Net Gun)是一种可无限重复使用的武器, 其使用和瞄准的难度远低于流星锤。<#RN#>7.) 战利品宝箱会在地图内随机生成。宝箱含大量灵魂, 武器等物品, 不过需要耗精华才能解锁。<#RN#>8.) 欧米伽采用了类似刷宝游戏的动态掉落系统, 当你击杀敌人时, 它们可能会掉落 Unique/Set items, custom charms, medallions, and more to greatly strengthen your player。<#RN#><#RN#>有了不错的武器和一些附魔的护甲, 还有一个据点, 那就开始进入下一阶段开始驯服吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2173235910"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "CE976ACB42D336061D73FFA7DB9B1E27",
      "Source": "Welcome, once again, to Ark Omega Ascended! Before we begin, stop. The game can be played as is, but for the ideal gameplay experience, there are several (non-premium) mods that are run on official, and recommended for use with all installs.<#RN#><#RN#>Recommended mods include:<#RN#><#RN#>- a modded spyglass (Awesome, Super, Nanoh’s, etc) for a quicklook indication of what kibble is needed to tame a dino, and how much of it.<#RN#>- The Omega teleporter and dino storage mods, as well as the egg collector – these are mods that were copied into discrete mods of their own from the ASE version of Omega.<#RN#>- An AOE drop collection mod such as Loot Grabber – Omega has quite a few drops that fall to the floor, and it’s very nice to not have to run around mashing E on everything in sight.<#RN#>- A reusable item mod such as QOL+ or Nanoh’s<#RN#>- A pulling system such as QOL+, PullIt! Or Automated Ark is very helpful.<#RN#>- A death inventory keeping mod is recommended as well, as Ark Omega Ascended is not intended to be played quite like vanilla ARK, but more like an ARPG such as Diablo or Path of Exile.<#RN#>- Stack mods are convenient, but use caution – some of them change items such as meat, which can cause your Ark Omega Ascended dinos to not eat the altered items properly.<#RN#><#RN#>Now that you’ve got your install squared away, let’s look at getting started.<#RN#><#RN#>When you first spawn in, you’ll notice you have a buff on your character and some neat new tools in your inventory. The buff is the Ark Omega newbie buff, which lasts for 10,000 seconds (slightly less than 3 hours), increases your Ark Omega rare item drop rate, gives you 90% damage mitigation, and massively reduces your aggro radius, allowing you to dodge most enemy dinos. The gathering tool functions as both a metal axe and metal pick – you can switch between the two by pressing the “Change Weapon Attachment” button. The knockout club delivers little damage but heavy torpor and occasional stun, useful for knocking out your first tames. The gathering sickle gathers anything you could gather by hand (e.g. berries, seeds, fiber) in a wide radius. It’s recommended to equip all these tools to your hotbar first thing.<#RN#><#RN#>And now you can get started in earnest! Your first goal is to acquire the material for an omega workbench, which is a level one engram, craftable in your inventory. Ideally you’ll also make an imbue workbench, with more of the same materials, for later. Then you can get to work getting the materials for your egg collector (if using as recommended), and then you can get to work knocking out dodos. If you have the egg collector, just females are fine – you can upload them and the egg collector will produce eggs according to your server egg laying rate setting. Otherwise you’ll want a male too, as dinos need to be mate-boosted to lay eggs. Next, you’ll want to make your kibble machine, a level six engram which is crafted in the omega workbench.<#RN#><#RN#>Now that you have your basic amenities built and perhaps have a little starter base to place them in, you need to begin killing things. You need souls and essence to make kibble to tame creatures for progression, and those only come from killing creatures with tiers and variants. If you have a reusable mod installed, this is the point where the reusable spear and bola come in very handy. Otherwise, use your favorite vanilla weapon; basic tier creatures aren’t much stronger than vanilla ark creatures statistics-wise, you can easily kill most early dinos with a primitive bow and stone arrows.<#RN#><#RN#>Optional but recommended: Kill three basic-tier (no tier listed, just [for instance] “Teleporter Dodo” or “Warp Lystrosaurus”) ethereal dinos, then take their souls and essence plus a spear (reusable or otherwise) to your omega workbench, and make an ethereal spear. This will make killing things go much faster. That’s if you haven’t gotten an Omega unique or legendary weapon such as “Burning Idol” or “Fate” to drop from a kill, of course – if you get a weapon drop, use it! They all have special effects and will cause you to kill things much faster.<#RN#><#RN#>Also optional but recommended: once you have some essence higher than basic tier, reserve six and craft a set of primitive armor like hide or cloth, as well as a primitive reflect shield in the omega workbench, then place them all plus your six essence in your imbue workbench, choose the type of essence you put in the workbench from the list, and click “imbue all” to give this gear some random stats when you wear it. This is very helpful early-game, before you’ve started getting gear drops. <#RN#><#RN#>Once you have at least one soul (such as a mythical soul) and five basic essence, as well as some raw meat, a dodo egg and some mejoberries, you can look into crafting your first kibble. Be warned: getting your first dino in Omega is not actually a power boost like it is in vanilla; you’re going to do more damage than your early tames, and (while you have the newbie buff) you’re also going to take less damage than they do. Ideally you’ll just tame one single-kibble female creature of each variant and tier up until elite, and keep them for egg production, rather than combat.<#RN#><#RN#>So, to summarize getting started:<#RN#><#RN#>- Gather until you can craft your Omega Workbench (and optionally your Imbue Workbench)<#RN#>- Find a safe place to set up a starter base, ideally away from dino spawns<#RN#>- Use your Omega Workbench to craft a Kibble Machine<#RN#>- Use your Knockout Club and Gathering Sickle to knock out and acquire berries to tame some dodos, which are one of a select few dinos in Ark Omega that don’t always spawn with variants.<#RN#>- Kill wild dinos for souls and essence while your tamed dodos lay eggs. (Crafting an Ethereal Spear and imbuing some armor will make this step easier and faster!)<#RN#>- Once you have an egg, a soul, and some basic essence, you’re on your way to making your first basic kibble, which you can use to tame a basic dino with a variant.<#RN#><#RN#>Once you’ve done all of this, you’re officially on your way in the early game – congratulations!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"再次欢迎来到《方舟：欧米茄飞升》！在我们开始之前，先停一停。游戏本身可以直接游玩，但为了获得理想的游戏体验，官方服务器运行着几个（非付费）模组，建议所有安装版本都搭配使用。<#RN#><#RN#>推荐模组包括：<#RN#><#RN#>1.一款模组望远镜（如 “Awesome”“Super”“Nanoh’s” 等），用于快速查看驯服恐龙所需的饲料种类及数量。<#RN#>2.欧米茄传送器、恐龙存储模组以及集蛋器 —— 这些模组是从《方舟：生存进化》欧米茄版本中拆分出来的独立模组。<#RN#>3.一款范围拾取模组，如 “Loot Grabber”—— 欧米茄中有不少掉落物会掉在地上，有了它就不用四处跑着按 E 拾取所有东西了，非常方便。<#RN#>4.一款可重复使用物品模组，如 “QOL+” 或 “Nanoh’s”。<#RN#>一款物品提取系统，如 “QOL+”“PullIt!” 或 “Automated Ark”，会非常实用。<#RN#>5.还建议安装死亡物品保留模组，因为《方舟：欧米茄飞升》的玩法并非完全像《方舟》原版，而更接近《暗黑破坏神》或《流放之路》这类动作角色扮演游戏。<#RN#>6.堆叠模组很方便，但使用时需谨慎 —— 有些堆叠模组会改变肉类等物品，可能导致《方舟：欧米茄飞升》中的恐龙无法正常食用这些被修改的物品。<#RN#><#RN#>现在你已经安装好游戏了，让我们看看如何开始。<#RN#><#RN#>初次重生时，你会发现角色身上有一个增益buff， inventory里还有一些新奇的工具。这个buff 是 “方舟欧米茄新手buff”，持续10,000 秒（略少于3小时），能提高欧米茄稀有物品的掉落率，提供90%的伤害减免，并大幅缩小你的仇恨范围，让你可以避开大多数敌对恐龙。采集工具兼具金属斧和金属镐的功能 —— 你可以按 “切换武器配件” 按钮在两者之间切换。击晕棒造成的伤害小，但能带来大量眩晕值，偶尔还能击晕目标，很适合用来击晕你要驯服的第一批恐龙。采集镰刀能在大范围内采集所有你徒手能采集的东西（如浆果、种子、纤维）。建议先把这些工具都装备到快捷栏上。<#RN#><#RN#>现在你就可以正式开始了！你的首要目标是获取制作欧米茄工作台的材料，这是一个 1 级印痕，可在你的 inventory 中制作。理想情况下，你还可以用同样的材料多做一个灌注工作台，留着以后用。然后你就可以着手准备制作集蛋器的材料（如果按推荐使用的话），之后就可以开始击晕渡渡鸟了。如果你有集蛋器，只需要雌性渡渡鸟就行 —— 你可以上传它们，集蛋器会根据服务器的产卵率设置产出蛋。否则，你还需要一只雄性渡渡鸟，因为恐龙需要有配偶加成才能产卵。接下来，你要制作饲料机，这是一个6级印痕，在欧米茄工作台中制作。<#RN#><#RN#>现在你已经搭建好了基本设施，或许还建了一个小的初始基地来放置这些设施，接下来你需要开始打怪了。你需要灵魂和精华为驯服生物、推进游戏进程制作饲料，而这些只能通过击杀有等级和变体的生物获得。如果你安装了可重复使用物品模组，这时可重复使用的长矛和 bola 就会非常有用。如果没有，就用你喜欢的原版武器；基础等级的生物在属性上并不比《方舟》原版生物强多少，你用一把原始弓和石箭就能轻松杀死大多数初期恐龙。<#RN#><#RN#>可选但推荐的做法：杀死3只基础等级的空灵生物（没有等级标注，比如只是 “传送渡渡鸟” 或 “传送水龙兽”），然后将它们的灵魂、精华以及一把长矛（可重复使用的或其他的）带到欧米茄工作台，制作一把空灵长矛。这会让打怪的速度快很多。当然，如果你在击杀生物时已经掉落了欧米茄独特或传奇武器，比如 “燃烧偶像” 或 “命运”，那就用这些武器！它们都有特殊效果，能让你更快地杀死敌人。<#RN#><#RN#>同样可选但推荐的做法：一旦你获得了一些高于基础等级的精华，预留6个，在欧米茄工作台制作一套原始盔甲，比如皮甲或布甲，以及一个原始反射盾，然后把这些装备和6个精华一起放进附魔工作台，从列表中选择你放入工作台的精华类型，点击 “全部附魔”，这样你穿上这些装备后就能获得一些随机属性。这在游戏初期，还没开始获得装备掉落时非常有用。<#RN#><#RN#>一旦你至少有了1个灵魂（比如神话灵魂）、5个基础精华，再加上一些生肉、1个渡渡鸟蛋和一些紫红色浆果，你就可以开始制作你的第一份饲料了。要注意：在欧米茄中，你驯服的第一只恐龙其实并不像在原版游戏中那样能增强你的实力；你造成的伤害会比你初期驯服的恐龙高，而且（在你有新手 buff 的情况下）你受到的伤害也会比它们少。理想情况下，你只需要驯服每种变体和等级（直到精英级）中只需一份饲料就能驯服的雌性生物，把它们留下来产蛋，而不是用于战斗。<#RN#><#RN#>总结一下入门步骤：<#RN#><#RN#>1.收集材料，直到能制作欧米茄工作台（可选制作灌注工作台）<#RN#>2.找一个安全的地方建立初始基地，最好远离恐龙生成点<#RN#>3.用欧米茄工作台制作饲料机<#RN#>4.用击晕棒和采集镰刀击晕渡渡鸟并收集浆果来驯服它们，渡渡鸟是《方舟：欧米茄》中少数并非总有变体的恐龙之一<#RN#>5.在你驯服的渡渡鸟产卵时，杀死野生恐龙获取灵魂和精华（制作一把空灵长矛并给一些盔甲灌注会让这一步更轻松、更快速！）<#RN#>6.一旦你有了蛋、灵魂和一些基础精华，你就可以开始制作你的第一份基础饲料了，用它可以驯服一只基础等级的变体生物<#RN#><#RN#>完成所有这些步骤后，你就正式开启游戏初期的旅程了 —— 恭喜你！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1764329681"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "C851B96F4E2081914DC8738EB7D806EF",
      "Source": "You’ve survived your first challenges and can now tame basic dinos – congratulations! Here begins the first grind of Ark Omega: the kibble tree.<#RN#><#RN#>If you’ve played a progression overhaul before, you’re likely familiar with the concept of taming creatures to use some feature of theirs to tame stronger creatures. If you haven’t, the way this works is relatively straightforward regardless: each successive tier’s kibble is crafted with the previous tier’s eggs. To tame, for instance, a delta spiritual dino, you need a kibble made using a basic ethereal egg – since the spiritual variant is a member of the ethereal group. This does mean you need to tame twelve different dinos per tier, though: one per variant group except lucky.<#RN#><#RN#>Variant groups are a concept unique to Ark Omega – there are thirteen variant groups, each with seven variants. Each group (except for lucky, which is a special case) lays one kind of egg – a water dino and a fire dino will both lay elemental eggs, for instance. You can find out more, including which variant is a member of which group, in the “Variants” tab, by selecting the button in the lower left corner of your guide.<#RN#><#RN#>Ark Omega also rewards going on foot: if you check the player rank tab in the guide, you’ll see a list of the number of kills you need to make on foot to go up in rank. This makes you take less damage, increasing your chances of survival when facing a high-tier creature while unmounted. Working on player rank while hunting creatures for egg production is a very efficient use of your time – you just kill whatever you don’t need to tame. This has the bonus of dropping quest scrolls, which you can use to get quests, <#RN#><#RN#>As you traverse the world, you may notice little chests in the shape of Rockwell survivor notes. These are actually loot chests, unlockable using essence, and they contain Omega items such as souls, upgrade materials, weapons, and blueprints. Open them when you can!<#RN#><#RN#>Another oddity you will almost certainly run across are the NPCs. There’s one tribe per variant group, using its weapon and armor set – for instance, the soul scream tribe that uses ethereal spears. They spawn with the small loot chests, so if you kill a tribe, be sure to search around where they were to find the chest that spawned them. Otherwise, exercise great caution if you see them – they’re deadly to tamed dinos and players alike. The danger is worthwhile, since each tribe leader is guaranteed to drop a unique or legendary weapon and an imbued, cursed piece of the gear set.<#RN#><#RN#>If you are very lucky, you may find a giant chest that asks for many types of essence. This is called a hoarder chest – and if you’re either very lucky or very unlucky, you may find that this chest has a guardian. At a low chance, when a hoarder chest spawns, so does a tameable Boss – a dragon, megapithecus, broodmother, manticore, dodorex or dodowyvern, with a tier and a variant. These are very dangerous and require either the unique or legendary warp bow, metal knockout arrows with a compound bow, or a creature with the “Infinite” variant, to knock them unconscious. (This is also the case for certain other high tier creatures, like giganotosauruses or rock elementals. This torpor mechanic is specifically called “Raid torpor”.)<#RN#><#RN#>As you progress through the world, there are some things it’ll be very helpful to you to find. You’ll want to kill cosmic dinos wherever you can for the chance of them dropping a unique or legendary warp bow and its armor set, gravity, you’ll want to accumulate a gear set and weapon to kill things with (all of them are good for different things; experiment as you accumulate more) and eventually you’ll want to acquire a strong, high-level dino to get to elite tier as you prepare to enter the midgame.<#RN#><#RN#>You’ll unlock the Omega beacon by killing a prime-tier or higher dino – on foot or mounted doesn’t matter, but it has to be you directly controlling whatever kills it in order to unlock the tekgram. Unlocking the beacon gives you access to summons – by placing as few as 10 or as many as 99 souls in the beacon’s inventory, it lets you summon a tameable dino of the variant you sacrificed the souls of; eg, 99 mythical souls could give you an elite siren carcharodontosaurus or an alpha fairy daeodon – more souls means both higher tier and larger or rarer dinos. This does include tameable Bosses so summon with care!<#RN#><#RN#>The main mechanic of the beacon, however, is that it is where you can summon Bosses. And that is where midgame begins.<#RN#><#RN#>So, to summarize the early game:<#RN#><#RN#>- Wander the world, taming female dinos from basic-tier through to elite-tier so that you have one of each tier in each variant group (though it is recommended to get one variant group to the point where you can tame elite tier dinos as soon as you can, so you can have a good strong mount early)<#RN#>- Kill everything you can that you don’t want to tame for drops and progression through the player ranks.<#RN#>- Try opening essence chests where you find them.<#RN#>- Kill some NPCs if possible, for item drops and player rank progress.<#RN#>- Get reliable access to some source of raid torpor if you’d like to eventually tame a species that requires raid torpor, such as a tameable Boss or a giganotosaurus.<#RN#>- Unlock the Omega beacon by making a kill of prime tier or higher, either on foot or with your first elite-tier mount, and use souls to summon potential tames using it.<#RN#>- Start preparing to do your first beacon Boss.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经成功挺过了最初的挑战，现在可以驯服基础等级的恐龙了——恭喜！这便是《方舟：欧米伽》首次需要艰苦努力的阶段的开始：龙蛋饲料体系。<#RN#><#RN#>如果你之前玩过游戏进程全面改版的游戏，你可能熟悉这样一个概念，即先驯服一些生物，利用它们的某些特性来驯服更强大的生物。如果你没玩过，无论如何，这里的运作方式相对简单直接：每一个更高等级的龙蛋饲料都要用前一等级的恐龙蛋来制作。例如，要驯服一只三角变异的灵体恐龙，你需要用基础的虚灵恐龙蛋制作的龙蛋饲料——因为灵体变异种属于虚灵恐龙类别。不过，这确实意味着每个等级你都需要驯服十二种不同的恐龙：除了“幸运”类别外，每个变异种类群都要驯服一只。<#RN#><#RN#>变异种类群是《方舟：欧米伽》独有的概念——一共有十三个变异种类群，每个种类群有七个变异种。每个种类群（“幸运”类别是特殊情况除外）都会产下一种蛋——比如，一只水属性恐龙和一只火属性恐龙都会产下元素蛋。你可以在“变异种”选项卡中了解更多信息，包括哪个变异种属于哪个种类群，方法是点击指南左下角的按钮。<#RN#><#RN#>《方舟：欧米伽》也鼓励徒步游戏：如果你查看指南中的玩家等级选项卡，你会看到一份清单，上面列出了你需要徒步击杀多少生物才能提升等级。这会让你受到更少的伤害，增加你在未骑乘状态下面对高等级生物时的生存几率。在为获取恐龙蛋而猎杀生物的同时提升玩家等级，是一种非常高效的时间利用方式——你只需杀死任何你不需要驯服的生物就行。这样做还有个额外好处，就是会掉落任务卷轴，你可以用它来领取任务。<#RN#><#RN#>当你在世界中穿行时，你可能会注意到一些形似罗克韦尔幸存者笔记的小箱子。这些实际上是战利品箱，可用精华开启，里面装有欧米伽物品，如灵魂、升级材料、武器和蓝图。有机会就打开它们吧！<#RN#><#RN#>你几乎肯定会遇到的另一件怪事就是非玩家角色（NPC）。每个变异种类群都有一个部落，他们使用各自种类群的武器和护甲套装——例如，使用虚灵长矛的“灵魂尖叫”部落。他们会和小战利品箱一起生成，所以如果你杀死了一个部落，一定要在他们出现的地方周围找找，看看生成他们的那个箱子。否则，如果你看到他们，一定要格外小心——他们对驯服的恐龙和玩家来说都极其致命。冒这个险是值得的，因为每个部落Boss肯定会掉落一件独特或传奇武器，以及一件灌注了且带有诅咒的装备套装部件。<#RN#><#RN#>如果你非常幸运，你可能会找到一个巨大的箱子，它需要多种类型的精华才能开启。这被称为囤积者宝箱——而且，无论你是非常幸运还是非常不走运，你可能会发现这个箱子有一个守护者。在囤积者宝箱生成时，有很低的几率会同时生成一只可驯服的Boss——喷火龙、银背金刚、育母蜘蛛、狮身蝎尾兽、嘟嘟霸王龙或嘟嘟飞龙，它们有各自的等级和变异种。这些非常危险，需要用独特或传奇的传送弓、复合弓搭配金属眩晕箭，或者用拥有“无限”变异种的生物，才能让它们昏迷。（对于某些其他高等级生物，如南方巨兽龙或岩石元素，也是如此。这种眩晕机制被专门称为“突袭眩晕”。）<#RN#><#RN#>当你在这个世界中不断前进时，有一些东西如果你能找到，会对你非常有帮助。无论在哪里，只要有机会，你都要杀死宇宙恐龙，因为它们有可能掉落独特或传奇的传送弓及其配套的“重力”护甲套装。你会想要积攒一套装备和一把武器来猎杀生物（所有装备和武器在不同方面都有各自的优势；随着你积攒得越多，可以多做尝试），最终，在你准备进入游戏中期时，你会想要获得一只强大的高等级恐龙，并将其提升到精英等级。<#RN#><#RN#>通过杀死一只顶级或更高等级的恐龙，你将解锁欧米伽信标——无论是徒步还是骑乘状态下杀死的都没关系，但必须是你直接控制着杀死恐龙的主体，才能解锁泰克科技蓝图。解锁信标后，你就可以进行召唤了——只需在信标的物品栏中放入少至10个、多至99个灵魂，它就能让你召唤出一只与你献祭的灵魂所属变异种相同的可驯服恐龙；例如，99个神话灵魂可以让你得到一只精英海妖南方巨兽龙或一只顶级精灵大角肉食牛龙——灵魂数量越多，召唤出的恐龙等级越高，体型越大或者越稀有。这确实包括可驯服的Boss，所以召唤时要小心！<#RN#><#RN#>然而，信标的主要机制在于，你可以用它来召唤Boss。而那便是游戏中期的开始。<#RN#><#RN#>所以，总结一下游戏前期的要点：<#RN#><#RN#>- 在世界中四处游历，驯服从基础等级到精英等级的雌性恐龙，这样每个变异种类群的每个等级你都能拥有一只（不过建议你尽快让其中一个变异种类群达到可以驯服精英等级恐龙的程度，这样你就能尽早拥有一只强大的坐骑）<#RN#>- 尽可能杀死任何你不想驯服的生物，以获取掉落物并提升玩家等级。<#RN#>- 尝试打开你找到的精华宝箱。<#RN#>- 如果可能的话，杀死一些非玩家角色（NPC），以获取物品掉落并提升玩家等级。<#RN#>- 如果你最终想要驯服某种需要“突袭眩晕”机制的物种，比如一只可驯服的Boss或南方巨兽龙，那么要确保能可靠地获得“突袭眩晕”的手段。<#RN#>- 无论是徒步还是骑着你的第一只精英等级坐骑，杀死一只顶级或更高等级的生物，解锁欧米伽信标，并使用灵魂通过它来召唤潜在的可驯服生物。<#RN#>- 开始准备挑战你的第一个信标Boss。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"4289102267"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "8EDF18864EE0263883391394902D9416",
      "Source": "Welcome to the midgame! By now you’ve beach Bobbed your way to victory over all sorts of things in the world, you can craft every kibble, you’ve got a strong mount and a preferred set of gear, and perhaps you’ve even imbued a shield at a tier above primitive, or rerolled some stats on your armor and charm. And you’ve got your beacon unlocked and a few hundred souls prepared to do your very first Bosses. You’ve also likely discovered the dimensional network structures – the void vacuum, which means you can just drop your inventory and have it sorted automatically once you’ve got the others set up, the unique totem to hold your unique and legendary items, the soul compressor for variant and paragon souls, the dimensional storage you can set to collate certain items, the dumpster to cleanly delete things such as rockwell notes and stone tools, and the grinder that takes up less space and gives back more resources when used to grind items put into it. All of these structures can actually be set to have specific things sorted into them directly from the void vacuum – it’s one of the best inventory management setups around, getting it set up to your preferences is a good idea before you start doing Bosses.<#RN#><#RN#>Item management aside, before you summon that first Boss, make sure to check the calculator for HP and damage and consider these other things you may need to be prepared for. <#RN#><#RN#>- Bosses hit pretty hard – does your tame have a good saddle, preferably imbued with at least elite essence? Ascendant is preferred, but anything past journeyman with at least 80 armor is perfectly sufficient.<#RN#>- Make sure you have a Reliquary structure crafted and placed, and one item-granted paragon level on your dino! If a dino with a paragon level from a paragon soul dies, it will be cryopodded and placed in the Reliquary at the cost of its paragon soul item paragon levels, rather than simply vanishing forever. This is, naturally, very good to have when you’re fighting Bosses, in case something goes drastically wrong.<#RN#>- Beacon Bosses can come out as any dino, so can you potentially chew through a stegosaurus’ damage reduction? Do you have enough stamina potions in case it’s a meganeura? Do you have enough health potions to heal through bleed in case it’s a thylacoleo? Do you have wake-up potions in case it’s a titanoboa?<#RN#>- Are you using an absorbent dino to tank damage for you? If so, are you or a tribemate (or ally – allied absorbent dinos can protect others) riding it, or do you have a potion dino to keep it topped up on stamina? An alpha-tier potion dino feeding alpha-tier potions should be sufficient for most purposes, if you’re using one at all. Otherwise, just make sure you have a few potions going at all times and it’ll likely be fine.<#RN#>- Are you in a place that is big enough to summon the Boss, but small enough that a flyer won’t get away to terrorize the countryside? Try to find enclosed-ish world spaces like the ice trench on the island if you can, or go ahead and find a placeable arena mod for your map now. (Do not try building a cage; Bosses ignore structures and summoning destroys nearby structures into the bargain.)<#RN#><#RN#>Once you’ve got all your supplies and your tame in your chosen location, go ahead and put that hundred souls into the beacon. It is strongly recommended to do your first Bosses at basic tier, to get a feel for them and also to get the souls to make whatever tames you’re using (tank, healer, damage dealer, etc) apex-tier before going any further. The souls need to match to upgrade a dino, so a colossus Boss soul for an elite colossus tame and so on. Note that you can use a variant soul to control what kind of Boss comes out, though this currently restricts them to basic tier.<#RN#><#RN#>On upgrading uniques past elite tier: just feed them a Boss soul of one of their variants to upgrade them. Either will do. It works the same way for taking them to apex, ultimate, etc. The soul just has to match one of their variants. Note that a cursed saddles’ variant may interfere with upgrading a dino – make sure to remove any saddles that give a variant before force-feeding the Boss/master/etc. soul!<#RN#><#RN#>This is the midgame gameplay loop: summon a beacon Boss with a hundred souls, kill it and put the Boss’ soul in the beacon to summon a master, kill the master and put the master’s soul in the beacon to summon a corrupt master. Each successive class of Boss will give stronger essence, each soul grinds for more shards that can be used to curse non-set gear, and the higher-tier essence can be used to imbue gear more strongly. Additionally, masters and corrupt masters will drop the mid-game sets and unique weapons such as Eye of the Storm and the Vengeance set that goes with it. These sets are much stronger than the early-game ones such as Soul Scream, and will strengthen you enough to potentially do beacon Bosses and beyond on foot.<#RN#><#RN#>So, midgame in summary:<#RN#><#RN#>- Prepare your elite-tier tame and yourself with strong armor and saddles with good imbues, health potions, at least one paragon soul item, and a crafted and placed Reliquary structure in case of tragedy.<#RN#>- Make sure you’re far from crafted structures, and in a place where there’s space to fight but not so much that a flyer could escape the battle.<#RN#>- Make sure you’re comfortable too – the fights shouldn’t be too long, but you should still go into them feeling good. If you’re worried, ask some friends to come along – Ark Omega’s at its best when you’re playing with a team.<#RN#>- Use Boss, master, and corrupt master souls to upgrade your tames’ tiers to make them stronger.<#RN#>- Get ready for the even stronger fights to come.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欢迎来到游戏中期！到目前为止，你已经凭借自己的努力在这个世界中战胜了各种各样的事物。你可以制作出各种龙蛋饲料，拥有了强大的坐骑和一套心仪的装备。也许你甚至已经给一个高于原始等级的盾牌进行了灌注，或者重新刷新了你的护甲和护符上的一些属性。而且你已经解锁了信标，并准备了几百个灵魂，打算挑战你的第一个 Boss。你可能也已经发现了维度网络建筑 —— 虚空吸尘器，这意味着一旦你设置好了其他相关设施，你只需扔下你的物品栏，它就会自动进行分类整理；还有独特的图腾，可以存放你的独特和传奇物品；灵魂压缩机用于处理变异灵魂和卓越灵魂；维度存储箱，你可以设置它来整理某些特定物品；垃圾桶，可以干净利落地删除诸如罗克韦尔笔记和石制工具之类的东西；以及研磨机，使用它来研磨放入其中的物品时，占用空间更小，还能返还更多资源。实际上，所有这些建筑都可以设置成直接从虚空吸尘器中分类放入特定物品 —— 这是周围最好的物品栏管理设置之一，在你开始挑战 Boss 之前，根据你的喜好设置好它是个不错的主意。<#RN#><#RN#>除了物品管理之外，在你召唤第一个 Boss 之前，一定要查看一下生命值和伤害计算器，并考虑这些你可能需要做好准备的其他事项。<#RN#><#RN#>- Boss 的攻击力相当高 —— 你的驯服生物是否有一个好鞍具，最好至少灌注了精英精华？极品鞍具是首选，但任何高于 journeyman（ journeyman 在游戏中一般可理解为熟练工、中级水平之类，具体含义根据游戏设定）等级且护甲至少为 80 的鞍具也完全足够。<#RN#>- 确保你已经制作并放置好了一个圣物箱建筑，并且你的恐龙拥有一个物品赋予的卓越等级！如果一只拥有由卓越灵魂赋予卓越等级的恐龙死亡，它将被放入低温舱，并放置在圣物箱中，代价是它的卓越灵魂物品所赋予的卓越等级，而不是直接永远消失。当你在与 Boss 战斗时，万一出现极其糟糕的情况，有这个设定自然是非常好的。<#RN#>- 信标召唤出的 Boss 可能是任何一种恐龙，那么你有可能突破剑龙的伤害减免吗？如果召唤出的是巨脉蜻蜓，你有足够的耐力药水吗？如果是袋狮，你有足够的治疗药水来抵消流血伤害吗？如果是泰坦巨蟒，你有唤醒药水吗？<#RN#>- 你是否使用了一只能够吸收伤害的恐龙来为你承受伤害呢？如果是这样，是你或你的部落成员（或盟友 —— 盟友的能吸收伤害的恐龙也可以保护其他人）骑着它，还是你有一只专门喂药的恐龙来保持它的耐力充足呢？如果你使用了专门喂药的恐龙，一只喂食顶级药水的顶级喂药恐龙在大多数情况下应该就足够了。否则，只要确保你随时准备好一些药水，这样可能就没问题了。<#RN#>- 你所在的地方是否足够大，能够召唤出 Boss，但又足够小，以至于飞行生物不会逃脱并去祸害周边地区呢？如果可以的话，尽量找到像岛屿上的冰谷那样相对封闭的世界空间，或者现在就为你的地图找到一个可放置的竞技场模组。（不要尝试建造笼子；Boss 会无视建筑，而且召唤 Boss 时还会摧毁附近的建筑。）<#RN#><#RN#>一旦你把所有的物资准备好，并且把你的驯服生物带到了你选择的地点，就把那一百个灵魂放入信标中吧。强烈建议你第一次挑战的 Boss 选择基础等级的，这样可以熟悉一下它们，同时也能获得灵魂，以便在进一步挑战之前，将你所使用的任何驯服生物（坦克、治疗者、输出者等等）提升到顶级。升级恐龙所需的灵魂必须与之匹配，例如，用精英巨像 Boss 的灵魂来升级一只精英巨像驯服生物，以此类推。请注意，你可以使用变异灵魂来控制召唤出的 Boss 种类，不过目前这只能将它们限制在基础等级。<#RN#><#RN#>关于将独特生物升级到精英等级以上：只需给它们喂食与它们其中一个变异种类对应的 Boss 灵魂就可以进行升级。任何一种匹配的变异 Boss 灵魂都可以。将它们提升到顶级、终极等级等也是同样的方法。灵魂只需与它们的其中一个变异种类相匹配即可。请注意，带有诅咒的鞍具的变异属性可能会干扰恐龙的升级 —— 在强制喂食 Boss、大师等灵魂之前，一定要移除任何会赋予变异属性的鞍具！<#RN#><#RN#>这就是游戏中期的玩法循环：用一百个灵魂召唤一个信标 Boss，杀死它并将 Boss 的灵魂放入信标中，以召唤出一个大师级 Boss，杀死大师级 Boss 并将其灵魂放入信标中，以召唤出一个堕落大师级 Boss。每一个更高等级的 Boss 都会掉落更强的精华，每一个灵魂在分解后会得到更多的碎片，这些碎片可用于诅咒非套装装备，而且更高等级的精华可以更强力地灌注到装备上。此外，大师级和堕落大师级 Boss 会掉落游戏中期的套装以及独特武器，比如 “风暴之眼” 和与之配套的 “复仇” 套装。这些套装比游戏早期的套装，比如 “灵魂尖叫” 套装要强大得多，它们会让你变得足够强大，有可能让你徒步挑战信标 Boss 以及更高级别的挑战。<#RN#><#RN#>所以，游戏中期总结如下：<#RN#><#RN#>- 准备好你的精英等级的驯服生物，给自己配备好强力的护甲和灌注良好的鞍具、治疗药水、至少一个卓越灵魂物品，并且制作并放置好一个圣物箱建筑，以防万一出现糟糕的情况。<#RN#>- 确保你远离已建造的建筑，并且处于一个有足够空间进行战斗，但又不会大到让飞行生物逃离战斗的地方。<#RN#>- 也要确保你自己状态良好 —— 战斗不应该持续太长时间，但你在进入战斗时仍然应该感觉良好。如果你感到担心，可以叫一些朋友一起来 ——《方舟：欧米伽》在你和团队一起玩的时候才是最有趣的。<#RN#>- 使用 Boss、大师和堕落大师的灵魂来提升你的驯服生物的等级，让它们变得更强大。<#RN#>- 为即将到来的更激烈的战斗做好准备。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"4084563917"}
    },
