    {
      "NamespaceHash": "AB22D03041E631DC12CC739BF7259BBE",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">Windburst</>: Creating a powerful torrent of wind that stun enemies caught in it.<#N#><#N#>_____<#N#>Cooldown: 10s<#N#>Stamina Cost: 30%<#N#>AoE Radius: 1500 (5 foundations)<#N#>Damage: 100% of Ability Damage as wind damage.<#N#>Weak Against (2x damage taken): Lightning<#N#>Resists (0.5x damage taken): Wind, Earth",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">Windburst</>: Creating a powerful torrent of wind that stun enemies caught in it.<#N#><#N#>_____<#N#>Cooldown: 10s<#N#>Stamina Cost: 30%<#N#>AoE Radius: 1500 (5 foundations)<#N#>Damage: 100% of Ability Damage as wind damage.<#N#>Weak Against (2x damage taken): Lightning<#N#>Resists (0.5x damage taken): Wind, Earth","JA":""},
