    {
      "NamespaceHash": "0D65CEA94EBAA477B47FCF9394AE8B36",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 1\">Pearl</>: Made of pearl, passively produce and poop pearl. Taking damage may cause it to break off shards, dealing explosion damage in an area and applying a Splintered debuff that further increases damage from shards.<#N#><#N#>_____<#N#>Elemental Weakness: Earth<#N#>Harvested For: Silica Pearls, Black Pearls<#N#>Drag weight increased: 3x<#N#>Amount of resource passively produced in inventory every 5 minutes: Tier x 10<#N#>Damage Reduction: 80% (20% damage taken)<#N#>Damage Taken by Elemental Weakness: 100%<#N#>Damage Taken by Multi-Tool: 200%<#N#>Shard Damage: 50% of Ability damage.<#N#>Shard Explosion Radius: 900 (3 foundations)<#N#>Splintered Debuff increases damage from shards by 5%, and can stack 100x.<#N#>Shard Chance %: (Damage Taken/Max Health) * 2000<#N#>Shard Chance increases by 10% for each hit that does not produce a shard.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 1\">Pearl</>: Made of pearl, passively produce and poop pearl. Taking damage may cause it to break off shards, dealing explosion damage in an area and applying a Splintered debuff that further increases damage from shards.<#N#><#N#>_____<#N#>Elemental Weakness: Earth<#N#>Harvested For: Silica Pearls, Black Pearls<#N#>Drag weight increased: 3x<#N#>Amount of resource passively produced in inventory every 5 minutes: Tier x 10<#N#>Damage Reduction: 80% (20% damage taken)<#N#>Damage Taken by Elemental Weakness: 100%<#N#>Damage Taken by Multi-Tool: 200%<#N#>Shard Damage: 50% of Ability damage.<#N#>Shard Explosion Radius: 900 (3 foundations)<#N#>Splintered Debuff increases damage from shards by 5%, and can stack 100x.<#N#>Shard Chance %: (Damage Taken/Max Health) * 2000<#N#>Shard Chance increases by 10% for each hit that does not produce a shard.","JA":""},
