    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "2DF316564D795E2E4990EEB0F10353C6",
      "Source": "Please Select A Button Below",
      "Trans": {"SC":"请选择下方的一个按钮","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2532381801"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "9783E30E4827D16D31994B98A943F947",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">Bosses:</><#RN#>These are the first group of Bosses that you'll summon, by using the Omega Beacon.<#RN#>The Omega Beacon is unlocked by killing a wild creature that is Prime tier or higher.. You will unlock the Tekgram, and can craft it at the Omega Workbench. The Omega Beacon can be used to summon wild tameable creatures, or you can place 100 souls inside to summon a Beacon Boss.<#RN#>These Bosses will spawn with a variant from the group of souls you have used in the beacon. These Bosses cannot be tamed. They must be killed. Killing them rewards a Boss Soul, which will appear as an orb on the ground. They may also unlock Tekgrams.<#RN#><#RN#>You have choices from here. <#RN#>1. Feed the Boss Soul to an Elite tier of the same variant, to increase its tier to Prime. <#RN#>2. Place the Boss Soul back into the beacon to summon a Master of the same variant. The tier of the Master will be based on the tier of the Boss Soul used to summon it. Be warned, Masters have 10x the base stats of a Boss, with a random 2nd variant from within their group.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 1, 0, 1\">Boss级(Bosses):</><#RN#>这些是你将遇到的第一组Boss级，可通过使用欧米茄信标召唤。<#RN#><#RN#>欧米茄信标的解锁方式是击杀一只 Prime（Prime级或更高等级的野生生物）。解锁后你将获得其印痕，可在欧米茄工作台制作该信标。欧米茄信标可用于召唤可驯服的野生生物，也可以在其中放入 100 个灵魂来召唤信标Boss。<#RN#><#RN#>这些Boss级生成时，会带有与你放入信标中的灵魂所属族群相对应的变体。这些Boss级无法被驯服，必须将其击杀。击杀它们会掉落一个Boss灵魂，以光球形式出现在地面上。它们还有可能解锁新的印痕。<#RN#><#RN#>从这里开始，你有以下选择：<#RN#><#RN#>1.将Boss灵魂喂给同变体的精英级生物，使其等级提升至Prime级。<#RN#>2.将Boss灵魂放回信标中，召唤同变体的主宰级(Master)。主宰的等级取决于用于召唤它的Boss灵魂的等级。需要注意的是，主宰的基础属性是Boss级的10倍，并且会随机带有一个来自其所属族群的第二种变体。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"732020789"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "EEFB6A204B5A9613C1CFB59D29043395",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 0.5, 0, 1\">Masters:</><#RN#>The Masters will likely be your first real challenge. It is not recommended to move into fighting Masters until you are able to farm a Prime tier beacon Boss of that variant. <#RN#>Summon a Master by placing a Boss Soul into the Omega Beacon. The variant/tier of the Master will match that of the Boss Soul used to create it. Make sure you always summon a basic tier Master first, before attempting to move onto the higher tiers. <#RN#><#RN#>Killing a Master will unlock the Omega Altar, and drop a Master Soul on the ground. The Master Soul can be used to rank up your tame to Apex tier.<#RN#><#RN#>You have choices from here. <#RN#>1. Feed the Soul to a Prime of the same variant. This will rank it up to Apex, doubling its stats.<#RN#>2. Collect the souls of every variant within that group, to place in the Omega Altar to summon a Group Master.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 0.5, 0, 1\">主宰级(Masters):</><#RN#>主宰很可能会是你遇到的第一个真正的挑战。在能够稳定击杀该变体的 Prime 级信标Boss之前，不建议贸然挑战主宰。<#RN#><#RN#>将Boss灵魂放入欧米茄信标即可召唤主宰。主宰的变体 / 等级会与用于召唤它的Boss灵魂一致。务必先从挑战基础等级的主宰开始，再尝试更高等级的主宰。<#RN#><#RN#>击杀主宰会解锁欧米茄祭坛，并在地面上掉落一个主宰灵魂。主宰灵魂可用于将你的驯服生物提升至顶点级。<#RN#><#RN#>从这里开始，你有以下选择：<#RN#><#RN#>1.将该灵魂喂给同变体的 Prime 级生物，使其晋升为顶点级，属性翻倍。<#RN#>2.收集该族群内所有变体的灵魂，将其放入欧米茄祭坛，以召唤族群主宰(Group Master)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2025268979"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "0769524D464982814A2F7A9295C8BC81",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">Group Masters:</><#RN#>Group Masters are much more difficult than the Masters you fought before. They have the abilities of all 6 variants within a group. Killing them is meant to be a raid, and killing them with just a single creature is very unlikely until you're later in the game. Strategy is a must, and fighting them in tribes or even with allied tribes will make these fights considerably easier. Summon a group master by placing one of each Master soul within a group (exclusing the 7th variant) into the Omega Altar.<#RN#><#RN#>Killing a Group Master will drop a Group Master Soul on the ground. The Group Master Soul can be used to rank up your tame to Ultimate tier.<#RN#><#RN#>You have choices from here. <#RN#>1. Feed the Soul to an Apex of a variant within the group of the Group Master killed. This will rank it up to Ultimate, doubling its stats.<#RN#>2. Place the Group Master soul into the Altar with a matching Group Master soul to summon a Unique Group Master.<#RN#>3. Place the Group Master soul into the Altar with the 7th variant Master soul from the same group to summon the Perfect Group Master.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">Group Masters(族群主宰):</><#RN#>族群主宰比你之前对抗过的Masters(主宰)要困难得多。它们拥有族群内所有 6 种变体的能力。击杀族群主宰的战斗本质上是一场团队突袭，在游戏后期之前，仅靠单个生物几乎不可能战胜它们。策略至关重要，加入部落或与联盟部落共同作战会让这些战斗轻松不少。召唤族群主宰的方法是，将某一族群内每种主宰灵魂（不包括第 7 种变体）各一个放入欧米茄祭坛。<#RN#><#RN#>击杀族群主宰后，地面上会掉落一个族群主宰灵魂。该灵魂可用于将你的驯服生物晋升至Ultimate(独特)级。<#RN#><#RN#>从这里开始，你有以下选择：<#RN#><#RN#>1.将该灵魂喂给族群主宰所属族群中某一变体的顶点级生物，使其晋升至Ultimate(独特)级，属性翻倍。<#RN#>2.将该族群主宰灵魂与一个同类型的族群主宰灵魂一同放入祭坛，以召唤Unique Group Master(独特族群主宰)。<#RN#>3.将该族群主宰灵魂与同族群的第 7 种变体主宰灵魂一同放入祭坛，以召唤Perfect Group Master(完美族群主宰)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3526780416"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "64A9F7CA4B8DBBB32241F0BCC5F3ABBB",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">Unique Group Masters:</><#RN#>Unique Group Masters are typically where the late-game starts. They take things significantly further than Group Masters. They have Group Variants, but 2 of them, and 10x the base stats of a Group master. To Summon one, put the 2 matching Group Masters Souls in the Omega Altar. Be warned, Unique Group Masters have 12 variant abilities and the fight can be visually intense. <#RN#><#RN#>Current Unique Group Masters:<#RN#>-Apocalypse: Cosmic/Nature<#RN#>-Anima: Mythical/Summoner<#RN#>-Alchemy: Unstable/Elemental<#RN#>-Indestructus: Guardian/Resource<#RN#>-Infinity: Ethereal/Utilit<#RN#>-Sin: Nightmare/Rage<#RN#><#RN#>Killing a Unique Group Master will drop a Unique Group Master Soul on the ground. The Group Master Soul can be used to rank up your tame to Ancient tier.<#RN#><#RN#>You have choices from here. <#RN#>1. Feed the Soul to an Ultimate of a variant within the grousp of the Unique Group Master killed. This will rank it up to Ancient, doubling its stats.<#RN#>2. Place the Unique Group Master soul into the Omega Beacon to summon an Aspect.<#RN#>3. Place the Unique Group Master soul into the Altar with the 2 matching 7th variant Master souls from the same groups to summon the Perfect Unique Group Master.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">独特族群主宰(Unique Group Masters):</><#RN#>独特族群主宰通常标志着游戏后期的开始。它们比普通族群主宰的难度有显著提升，拥有两个族群变体，且基础属性是普通族群主宰的 10 倍。召唤方法是，将两个同类型的族群主宰灵魂放入欧米茄祭坛。需要注意的是，独特族群主宰拥有 12 种变体能力，战斗场面会非常激烈。<#RN#><#RN#>当前的独特族群主宰包括：<#RN#><#RN#>Current Unique Group Masters:<#RN#>-Apocalypse: Cosmic/Nature<#RN#>-Anima: Mythical/Summoner<#RN#>-Alchemy: Unstable/Elemental<#RN#>-Indestructus: Guardian/Resource<#RN#>-Infinity: Ethereal/Utilit<#RN#>-Sin: Nightmare/Rage<#RN#><#RN#>击杀独特族群主宰后，地面会掉落一个独特族群主宰灵魂。该灵魂可用于将你的驯服生物晋升至远古级(Ancient)。<#RN#><#RN#>从这里开始，你有以下选择：<#RN#><#RN#>将该灵魂喂给独特族群主宰所属族群中某一变体的终极级生物，使其晋升至远古级(Ancient)，属性翻倍。<#RN#>将该独特族群主宰灵魂放入欧米茄信标，以召唤化身级(Aspect)。<#RN#>将该独特族群主宰灵魂与同族群的两个第 7 种变体主宰灵魂一同放入祭坛，以召唤完美独特族群主宰(Perfect Unique Group Master)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3069877318"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "5D314D7B438E32EDE5FDD89F14795908",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">Aspects:</><#RN#>Aspects are where things can get tricky. They each have one variant from each of the 12 main groups which gives them a wide variety of abilities. To summon one, put a Unique Group Master Soul into the Omega Beacon. <#RN#><#RN#>Current Aspects and their variants:<#RN#>Aspect of Anarchy: Gamma-Ray, Fireburst, Teleporter, Resilient, Colossus, Banshee, Eruption, Uncontrollable, Stone, Random, Meltdown, Crafting<#RN#>Aspect of Eternity: Meteor, Windburst, Astral, Collective, Phoenix, Vampire, Tornado, Brutal, Obsidian, Necromancer, Self-Destructive, Harvesting<#RN#>Aspect of Exploitation: Comet, Lightningburst, Echo, Absorbent, Gorgon, Stalker, Thunderstorm, Rampage, Metal, Cloner, Detonate, Taming<#RN#>Aspect of Infection: Starfire, Earthburst, Warp, Shield, Pygmy, Zombie, Plague, Frenzy, Wood, Overlord, Explosive, Breeding<#RN#>Aspect of Madness: Singularity, Iceburst, Spiritual, Control, Siren, Boogeyman, Blizzard, Psychosis, Crystal, Familiar, Volatile, Farming<#RN#>Aspect of Void: Supernova, Waterburst, Dimensional, Reflective, Fairy, Ghost, Tsunami, Knockback, Pearl, Companion, Reactive, Tracker<#RN#><#RN#>Upon killing them, they will drop an Aspect Soul on the ground. Feeding this soul to an Ancient tier will increase its tier to Endless.<#RN#><#RN#>You have choices from here. <#RN#>1. Feed the Soul to an Ancient tier tame. This will rank it up to Endless, doubling its stats.<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">化身(Aspect):</><#RN#>化身级别的战斗会变得棘手起来。每个 Aspect 都拥有 12 个主要族群中各一个变体的能力，这使它们具备了五花八门的技能。若要召唤一个化身，需将一个独特族群主宰(Unique Group Master)灵魂放入欧米茄信标。<#RN#><#RN#>当前的化身级及其变体如下：<#RN#>Aspect of Anarchy: Gamma-Ray, Fireburst, Teleporter, Resilient, Colossus, Banshee, Eruption, Uncontrollable, Stone, Random, Meltdown, Crafting<#RN#>Aspect of Eternity: Meteor, Windburst, Astral, Collective, Phoenix, Vampire, Tornado, Brutal, Obsidian, Necromancer, Self-Destructive, Harvesting<#RN#>Aspect of Exploitation: Comet, Lightningburst, Echo, Absorbent, Gorgon, Stalker, Thunderstorm, Rampage, Metal, Cloner, Detonate, Taming<#RN#>Aspect of Infection: Starfire, Earthburst, Warp, Shield, Pygmy, Zombie, Plague, Frenzy, Wood, Overlord, Explosive, Breeding<#RN#>Aspect of Madness: Singularity, Iceburst, Spiritual, Control, Siren, Boogeyman, Blizzard, Psychosis, Crystal, Familiar, Volatile, Farming<#RN#>Aspect of Void: Supernova, Waterburst, Dimensional, Reflective, Fairy, Ghost, Tsunami, Knockback, Pearl, Companion, Reactive, Tracker<#RN#><#RN#>击杀它们后，地面会掉落一个化身级灵魂。将此灵魂喂给远古级(Ancient)生物，可使其等级提升至无尽级(Endless)。<#RN#><#RN#>从这里开始，你有以下选择：<#RN#><#RN#>将该灵魂喂给一只远古级驯服生物，使其晋升至无尽级，属性翻倍。<#RN#><#RN#>将该灵魂喂给一只Ancient级驯服生物，使其晋升至Endless级，属性翻倍。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2936253434"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "9E7010794660395BCBD7EEB575C262AA",
      "Source": "Mating",
      "Trans": {"SC":"繁殖","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"678225980"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "8535459C41BAEB4DDA325DB5FF192C92",
      "Source": "Mating and EggsTo get things out of the way, lets describe some vanilla mating and egg mechanics as most modded Ark players have no idea how this works.1. Creatures must be mate boosted to lay unfertilized eggs. The exceptions are dinos that poop eggs (Dodo + Kairuku).2. Creatures must be the same species to mate. Dodo + Dodo. You cannot mate a Dodo with a Rex (people really ask this).3. Ark Omega creatures cannot mate with vanilla creatures. They may look the same, but are not technially the same species.First thing is your BreedingMode setting. This setting determines what you can mate together. This can be changed in the Admin panel of the guide.IF YOUR MATING TIMER IS RESETTING ON DINOS WHILE TRYING TO MATE, THIS IS THE CAUSE.The default setting is 1, but you can change this to any of the 5 settings. 1. Same Group (Cosmic + Cosmic) but any Tier. If variants are different between the parents, one of their variants will be selected at random using spawn chance % for those 2 variants.2. Same Variant and Tier.3. Any variant and any Tier. If variants are different between the parents, one of their variants will be selected at random using spawn chance % for those 2 variants.Second is the PoopEggs INI setting. This setting bypasses the default Ark mechanic of requiring mate boosting to lay eggs.With this setting, all creatures, even male, will have a 1% chance to produce an unfertilized egg when pooping. Now that you have your settings determined, here are the basics of what can happen when mating.If variants are different between the parents, the % chance of the baby's variant is based on the spawn chances of the variants of the parents. Example: Colossus and Gorgon mate, there is a much greater chance for a Gorgon baby than Colossus. 2. If you're breeding different Tiers, the tier can be anywhere between the 2 parents, with lower tiers being far more likely.3. If your egg hatches a Dodo, then you're using another mod that is either picking up the eggs too soon or editing them.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"交配与产卵<#RN#>首先，我们来介绍一下原版游戏中的交配和产卵机制 —— 大多数《方舟》模组玩家可能并不清楚这些内容：<#RN#><#RN#>生物必须获得配偶加成才能产下未受精的卵。例外情况是那些会 “排泄卵” 的恐龙（如渡渡鸟、企鹅）。<#RN#>生物必须是同一物种才能交配（例如渡渡鸟只能和渡渡鸟交配）。你不能让渡渡鸟和霸王龙交配（真的有人会问这种问题）。<#RN#>《方舟：欧米茄》中的生物不能与原版生物交配。它们可能看起来一样，但严格来说并非同一物种。<#RN#>繁殖模式设置<#RN#>首先要了解的是 “繁殖模式” 设置，它决定了哪些生物可以相互交配，你可以在指南的管理员面板中修改该设置。如果尝试交配时，恐龙的交配计时器不断重置，就是这个设置导致的。<#RN#><#RN#>默认设置为 1，但你可以将其改为以下 5 种模式中的任意一种：<#RN#><#RN#>模式 1：同一族群（如 “宇宙” 族群与 “宇宙” 族群），但可以是任意等级。如果父母的变体不同，幼崽的变体将从父母的两种变体中随机选择，概率基于它们的生成几率。<#RN#>模式 2：同一变体且同一等级。<#RN#>模式 3：任意变体且任意等级。如果父母的变体不同，幼崽的变体将从父母的两种变体中随机选择，概率基于它们的生成几率。<#RN#>“排泄产卵” INI 设置<#RN#>该设置可以绕过《方舟》原版中 “需要配偶加成才能产卵” 的机制。<#RN#><#RN#>开启此设置后，所有生物（甚至雄性）在排泄时，都有 1% 的概率产下一枚未受精的卵。<#RN#>交配可能出现的基本情况<#RN#>在确定了上述设置后，交配时可能会出现以下基本情况：<#RN#><#RN#>1.如果父母的变体不同，幼崽变体的概率取决于父母双方变体的生成几率。例如：“巨人” 与 “蛇发女妖” 交配，幼崽是 “蛇发女妖” 的概率远高于 “巨人”。<#RN#>2.如果你繁殖不同等级的生物，幼崽的等级可能介于父母双方的等级之间，但低等级的可能性要大得多。<#RN#>3.如果你的卵孵化出了渡渡鸟，那说明你正在使用的其他模组要么过早拾取了卵，要么对卵进行了修改。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"355070192"}
    }
  ]
}